        a                       ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment            "Embroidered silk on linen; Spain; 1700s"@en , "Silk embroidery on linen in double-running and satin stitches and French knots. Bands of border and corner patterns in pink, blue, yellow, and green silk, alternating with bands of drawn work. At the top is a broad band of detached motifs, vases of flowers, animals, etc."@en ;
